<ix:continuation id="f-1210-2"><div style="margin-top:9pt"><span data-b13-style-ref="42">Other Related Parties</span></div><div style="margin-top:9pt;text-indent:22.5pt"><span data-b13-style-ref="43">We earned gross fee revenues plus reimbursement of certain expenses from franchised and managed properties in which members of the Marriott family hold varying interests. These amounts are not material to our Financial Statements.</span></div></ix:continuation>